OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
# THE GAME MODE. It names the pawn and the controller, which is what makes the play session spawn and possess them (the
# FirstPerson template's AN_FPRules explains why both are required). Two copies of this tick in a headless log because the map-less game
# mode is spawned once by begin_play; they do not interfere.
NAME VehicleRules
DESCRIPTION The game mode, as a graph: the play session's pawn, controller and a round clock.

CLASS AN_VehicleRules GameMode pawn=AN_VehicleDriver controller=AN_VehicleController

PARAM deltaTime float
VAR elapsed float 0

ENTRY tick OnTick
NODE dt Param param=deltaTime
NODE tick OnTick
NODE prev GetVar var=elapsed
NODE sum Add
NODE store SetVar var=elapsed
NODE report GetVar var=elapsed
LINK prev.value sum.a
LINK dt.value sum.b
LINK tick.exec store.exec
LINK sum.result store.value
OUT report value
